// Hand-authored Pine v5 fixture — indicator with a custom user-defined
// function. Tests that function declarations survive the migration
// untouched (no v5/v6 syntactic diff at the function-decl layer per the
// TradingView migration guide).
//
// Per PRD §2.1: hand-authored, not copied from TradingView.
//
// Covers: study() → indicator(), custom one-line function form
// `f(x) => expr`, ta.sma call, plot().
//@version=5
study("Smoothed Range", overlay=false)
length = input.int(14, minval=1)
smooth(src) => ta.sma(src, length)
range_ = high - low
smoothed = smooth(range_)
plot(smoothed)
